# q91d (7 Nov 2026) = q91c + 0031-q91d: cpufreq boost locking, EM boost ranking (upstream form), msm VM_BIND fixes, UCSI / dwc3 / DP PHY alt-mode fixes, pmic_glink_altmode, rpmh, UFS, ath12k, wcd939x / SoundWire, nt36536 pen reports, GMU interrupts masked before boot. Config: + configs/q91d.config.
# Kernel 7.4.0-rc1-iceland-00645-ge71b4b12aba6.
